Core concepts

Issue: A problem/concern raised by a user. Supports parent/child (sub-issue) relationships, similarity links, categories/labels, urgency, counterpoints, computed impact, and linked solutions.

PotentialSolution: A reusable solution idea that can be linked to multiple issues (many-to-many).

Category/Label (Tag): Controlled taxonomy (categories) plus optional freeform labels (tags).

Upvote: Unique user endorsement of an issue (deduped by user across a tree for the roll-up metric).

SimilarityLink: Connects issues that are semantically similar with a similarity score and “difference summary”.

User: Minimal profile for attribution, auditing, and dedupe.

